=== DOES A PRIOR FOR THE UNKNOWN EARN POINTS, AND DOES PRICE ORDER IT?
Baseline reproduces the defect: a player with no prior reads zero
expected minutes before the season starts.
⚠️ Pre-registered from the ORDERING instrument, AMENDED 2026-08-28
before this sweep was ever run, because its basis was withdrawn.
It read: the fix alone is negative on ordering in every season, so
expect it flat-to-negative here. That negative is a POOLING artefact
-- within position the fix's prediction is CONSTANT in every season,
so it has no ordering at all, and the pooled rho was a rank by
position. The amended prediction: the fix alone moves points only
through the LEVEL it assigns, which is over-stated against the known
population by 1.5-1.9x outfield and 4.5x for goalkeepers, so expect
it to be flat-to-negative for THAT reason; and expect the fix+price
contrast to carry whatever positive there is, since price is the only
arm that orders these players at all.
⚠️ Read HOLD at --scale=per_gw, and read the moves column first.

